<title>FINLAND: FINNISH T-BILL AUCTION RAISES 253 MLN.</title>
<headline>FINNISH T-BILL AUCTION RAISES 253 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury</p>
<p>Office's T-Bill auction November 12 versus November 5:</p>
<p>		     THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days   182/159     365/342</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   3.15/3.10    No bids accepted</p>
<p> Highest yld     3.15/3.11</p>
<p> Lowest  yld     3.14/3.09</p>
<p> Amount, FIM mln  253/100     nill/nill</p>
<p> Bids, FIM mln    393/100     250/nill</p>
<p>Total planned issue amount was 1.0 billion markka. After</p>
<p>today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is</p>
<p>41,775 million markka, the STO said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
</text>
